flowchart LR
    subgraph Capture[Capture layer]
      A[Camera / webcam / URL / file / agent] --> B[Source adapter and health]
      B --> C[Sampling / ROI / privacy masks]
    end
    subgraph Analysis[Analysis layer]
      C --> D[Priority scheduler and bounded queue]
      D --> E[Liquid d1-3B adapter]
      D --> F[Other CV / OCR / tracking adapters]
      E --> G[Normalised typed observations]
      F --> G
    end
    subgraph Measure[Measurement layer]
      G --> H[State machine and metrics]
      H --> I[Rules and alerts]
    end
    G --> J[(Observations / events / metrics DB)]
    H --> J
    I --> J
    C --> K[(Evidence image store)]
    J --> L[Authenticated API / dashboard]
    K --> L
    I --> M[Notification sinks]
